#: ../../source/guides/configuration.md:1 e08a788e4b9e487dbf8634a9ce6a482c
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/configuration.md:3 349f2b65aae34ffea5cf662267e300cd
msgid ""
"`findfmt` supports flexible, structured configuration loading through "
"standard TOML files. This enables setting persistent personal defaults or"
" project-level standards for output formatting, visual styling, traversal"
" boundaries, and tag filtering."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/configuration.md:9 d8365f9e961f46cb85365c1961394ae5
msgid "1. Configuration Resolution Hierarchy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/configuration.md:11 d017ccbd436f43ecb8634c7257ac59b2
msgid ""
"When `findfmt` executes, it determines effective settings according to a "
"strict six-tier hierarchy where higher-priority sources override lower-"
"priority sources:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/configuration.md:14 0bb2fa37c66f4f74b2f75428887a1129
msgid ""
"**Explicit CLI arguments and flags** (Highest Priority): Direct options "
"passed on the command line (e.g. `--format table`, `--no-hidden`, `-t "
"python`) always override environment variables and file settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/configuration.md:17 a3397fb390c342dcb8ee508d341dd9ff
msgid ""
"**Environment Variables**: System environment settings such as "
"`NO_COLOR`, `CLICOLOR`, `CLICOLOR_FORCE`, `LANGUAGE`, and `LC_*` override"
" file defaults."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/configuration.md:19 70e5f4b83b6f48c7ba2023dad7202c0b
msgid ""
"**Explicit Configuration File**: A custom configuration path specified "
"via `--config <path>` or the `FINDFMT_CONFIG` environment variable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/configuration.md:21 159ecbbc5fc948e69e8cfbf3b6e268a3
msgid ""
"**Standard User Configuration Path**: User-level configuration located at"
" `$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/findfmt/config.toml` (or "
"`~/.config/findfmt/config.toml` on POSIX systems; "
"`%APPDATA%\\findfmt\\config.toml` on Windows)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/configuration.md:24 84a6789241114780b30fb5db8e119ce3
msgid ""
"**Project Local Configuration**: A `pyproject.toml` file containing a "
"`[tool.findfmt]` table located in the current working directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/configuration.md:26 9ad08037ac7c438ba1754e80ea84350b
msgid ""
"**Built-in Defaults** (Lowest Priority): Factory default options (`format"
" = \"text\"`, `color = \"auto\"`, `pager = \"auto\"`, etc.)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/configuration.md:30 f879e7eab8374f1681e6776b64b953d1
msgid ""
"Passing `--no-config` on the command line or setting "
"`FINDFMT_CONFIG=\"\"` completely suppresses discovery and loading of "
"configuration files, forcing `findfmt` to rely strictly on built-in "
"defaults and command-line flags."
msgstr ""

